  "as_of_notes": "Official monthly report 'New Mexico Voter Registration Statistics \u2014 Statewide by County', as of May 31, 2026 (most recent available; June 2026 not yet posted as of retrieval). Source PDF 'Statewide 05-31-2026.pdf' published in the SOS 2026 Voter Registration Data section (RealFile widget; direct file: https://klvg4oyd4j.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/prod/PublicFiles/ee3072ab0d43456cb15a51f7d82c77a2/ac289a49-50f1-4a68-b380-971e62cecd05/Statewide%2005-31-2026.pdf ).",
  "data_quality": "high",
  "notes": "All 33 New Mexico counties included. Party categories follow the official SOS report: Democratic, Republican, 'No Party/Declined to Select' (mapped to DeclineToState / DTS), and 'Other'. The SOS report does NOT break out Libertarian separately \u2014 Libertarian and all minor parties are aggregated into 'Other', so Libertarian is null. Sums verified: each county's party columns sum to its total, and county totals sum to the statewide total of 1,423,734 (DEM 573,161; REP 442,802; DTS 380,276; Other 27,495), matching the report's printed TOTAL line exactly. FIPS codes assigned per ANSI/Census NM county codes."
